hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1671","Narrated to us Abu Qudāmah and Ziyād ibn Yaḥyā (RA), who said: Sufyān narrated to us, and Abu Qudāmah (RA) said: 'Ubaydullāh narrated to me, while Ziyād said: From 'Ubaydullāh ibn Abī Yazīd, from his father, from Umm Ayyūb (RA), who said:\n\n\The Prophet (ﷺ) came to stay with us"","" so we prepared food for him that contained some greens. When it was placed before him"","" he said to his companions: 'Eat"","" for indeed I am not like any of you. I fear that my companion (i.e."","" Jibrīl) may be harmed.'\n\nAbu Qudāmah (RA) also said"","" from Umm Ayyūb (RA): 'He came to stay with her"",""' and she narrated to me"","" saying: 'The Prophet (ﷺ) came to stay with us.'\""\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""""
